  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:46:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. My name is Deirdre Dolan. I have an old washing machine in my garage, and I want to know how I can get the city to haul it away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a washing machine. And where are you located, Deirdre?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "304 Ruggles Avenue, on the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 304 Ruggles. So, large appliance pickup, I'm jotting that down. Is it out at the curb now, or still in the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still in the garage. With the snow and the rain today, I did not want to put it outside to get wet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Honestly, I'm not sure of the exact steps for appliances, so I'd rather have a supervisor go over it with you. Want a call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, I would like that. A supervisor can call me at 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six eight, perfect. I'll put that in with the washer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. A friend told me this office is very good with helping people, so I called you first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's nice to hear. Somebody will call you back today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T08:47:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you, Kevin. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
